n<td>房地产、建材</td>\n<td>建设活动</td>\n<td>固定资产投资</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"地理位置数据\">地理位置数据</h3><p>手机地理位置数据提供了消费者行为的实时画像：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def foot_traffic_signal(location_data, store_mapping, stock_id):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    基于人流量数据构建消费类公司的收入预测信号&#10;&#10;    参数:&#10;        location_data: 包含 POI 日均访问量的时间序列&#10;        store_mapping: POI 到上市公司的映射&#10;        stock_id: 目标股票&#10;    返回:&#10;        signal: 人流量变化信号&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    stores = store_mapping[store_mapping[&#39;stock_id&#39;] == stock_id]&#10;    store_visits = location_data[location_data[&#39;poi_id&#39;].isin(stores[&#39;poi_id&#39;])]&#10;&#10;    daily_total = store_visits.groupby(&#39;date&#39;)[&#39;visits&#39;].sum()&#10;&#10;    current_4w = daily_total.iloc[-28:].mean()&#10;    previous_4w = daily_total.iloc[-56:-28].mean()&#10;    yoy_same_period = daily_total.iloc[-365-14:-365+14].mean()&#10;&#10;    mom_signal = (current_4w / previous_4w - 1) if previous_4w &gt; 0 else 0&#10;    yoy_signal = (current_4w / yoy_same_period - 1) if yoy_same_period &gt; 0 else 0&#10;&#10;    return 0.5 * mom_signal + 0.5 * yoy_signal\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> foot_traffic_signal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(location_data, store_mapping, stock_id):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    基于人流量数据构建消费类公司的收入预测信号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    参数:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span 